<title>LITHUANIA: AGRICULTURAL BANK IN 8.9 MLN LITAS NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>AGRICULTURAL BANK IN 8.9 MLN LITAS NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First seven months of 1997</p>
<p>(amounts in million of litas unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    8.9     vs 5.7</p>
<p>    Assets			1.476 bln vs 1.275 bln</p>
<p>    Total deposits		863     vs  728</p>
<p>    Individual deposits	 530     vs  570</p>
<p>    Loan portfolio		936.5   vs 1.084 bln</p>
<p>    Net loans		     761     vs  916</p>
<p>Notes: The figures for assets, total deposits, individual</p>
<p>deposits, loan porfolio and net loans are compared to the</p>
<p>beginning of 1997.</p>
<p>The state-run Agricultural Bank posted a 12.98 million</p>
<p>litas net profit in the first half of the year. Its assets as</p>
<p>of the end of June were 1.336 billion litas,  its loan</p>
<p>portfolio was 976 million litas and total deposits were 723</p>
<p>million litas.</p>
<p>The state-run bank posted a 25.5 million litas net profit</p>
<p>in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
